<title>JAPAN: Japan Nov large store sales down 0.3 pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>Japan Nov large store sales down 0.3 pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-12-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sales at Japanese department stores and supermarkets fell 0.3 percent in November from a year earlier to 1.90 trillion yen, the Ministry of International Trade and Industry said on Thursday.</p>
<p>A breakdown of year-on-year changes:</p>
<p>			     NOV	     OCT (REVISED)</p>
<p>  Department stores    +1.5	     +1.4</p>
<p>  Supermarkets	   -2.0	     -0.1</p>
<p>  Total		    -0.3	     +0.6</p>
</text>
